# redundant-cast: TStringList(SL) where SL is already TStringList (line 11) fires.
# Must NOT fire on the constructor call (10), a plain call (12), or a non-T-prefixed
# scalar cast Integer(N) (13, deliberately excluded to avoid scalar-cast noise).
redundant-cast 11
!redundant-cast 10
!redundant-cast 12
!redundant-cast 13
